WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.880
STOP IT!

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.830
It's reading all my moves?!

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.920
This thing is different than
any monster we've fought today.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.750
Wait a second!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.000
Is it an enhanced species?!

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.750
Don't go in too deep!

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.130
Backup is on the way!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.380
No, don't!

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.830
You must... run!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.460
Avoid that attack...

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.210
Don't get hit!

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.290
Lady Chigusa!

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:31.960
I don't believe it. The monster ran away?!

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.170
Chigusa!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:34.330
Hang in there, Chigusa!

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.750
It's the green moss...

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.460
that will engulf everything...

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:43.710
P-please don't!

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.630
I'm begging you!

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:07.500
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.420
<b>Parasite</b>

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.420
<b>Viscum Album</b>

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.420
Oh solar rays, I beseech you to ward off affliction.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.040
Soul Light.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:32.080
Chigusa!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.420
It's not working!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.130
The seed that penetrated inside of her

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.790
has taken root all over her body.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:47.380
It seems to be sapping their
strength to use as nourishment.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.460
That means healing magic and
potions aren't going to help.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.960
It'll just make it worse by causing
the vines to grow even more.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:56.880
Poor Chigusa...

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.290
So it's basically a parasite.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.000
The monster is using them as a host to leech off of!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.460
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.580
I'm not going to be able to save them...

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.540
What we need right now are ideas!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:31.000
So please share your thoughts with us, Cassandra!
Is there anything we can possibly do to save them?

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.130
Nobody is dead yet!

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.880
And we have a full party!

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.040
I know we can save them if we put our heads together!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.960
In order to save them, I think we should hurry back
to the surface and find a more experienced healer...

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:54.250
Like maybe the Dea Saint from
the Dian Cecht Familia could help them.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.080
Or alternatively,

00:05:56.420 --> 00:06:00.420
we could try destroying the source that implanted
the seeds in them. That might wipe the plant out.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.130
Does anyone else have any ideas?

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.000
I would like to hear them.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.540
All I'm really good for is combat.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.210
Which makes me worthless right now.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.880
So please think! I need you to lend me your expertise!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.040
Of course, Master Bell.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.130
Yeah, Bell is totally right.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.330
This calls for a productive conversation.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.130
We can figure out a way through
this by putting our minds to it.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:35.460
Personally, I think the only options we have right now
are the ones that Lady Cassandra already mentioned.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.000
Hurrying back up to the surface,

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.380
or going to hunt down that monster. Right?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.790
Yes. I'm in favor of leaving the dungeon immediately.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:48.750
That monster is an enhanced species that's
clearly assimilated a large number of magic stones.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:53.460
We all saw how it fought against Master Bell.
Trying to eliminate it would invite too much risk.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:55.080
That's for sure.

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:58.920
But it begs the question, what kind of
species is that monster in the first place?

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.960
My guess would be a Moss Huge.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:07.040
Although there shouldn't be any around here
because they normally spawn on the middle floors.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:11.880
It must have strengthened itself by eating magic stones
and then made its way down to the lower floors.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:17.960
Even if we want to kill the monster, this floor is so
expansive that we might have trouble finding it again.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.080
We also need to consider the condition of the injured,

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.500
which is why I think returning to the surface is best.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.250
No...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.460
That monster is bound to show up again...

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:31.880
Mr. Luvis!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:39.170
Never thought I'd be getting saved by you... Little Rookie.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:45.630
My party is still out there.
They were left behind somewhere on this floor.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:48.880
Please eradicate that nasty monster,

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.830
and save my comrades!

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:56.130
You've gotta be kidding. Are you saying
you just ditched your party and ran away?

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.130
Don't be... ridiculous...

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.630
I was the one acting as decoy...

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.540
What do you mean?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.630
And why are you so certain
the monster will show up again?

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.170
It was... after these...

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:12.670
Magic stones?!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:16.330
You mean that monster was hunting
adventurers for their magic stones?!

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.080
I've never heard of that happening before!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.960
Well, it's true.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:28.040
That Moss Huge took us completely
by surprise and stole our stones.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:32.330
Then it ate them all right in front of us.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.880
And soon after, it started to attack us
with overwhelming force...

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.790
We ended up having these vines
implanted in our bodies,

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.460
which left us with no choice but to flee.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.460
But it kept doggedly chasing after us!

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:56.710
So you grabbed the magic stones and played decoy
to divert its attention from the others?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.960
There were 4 of us in the party... all level 3...

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.670
We're used to exploring the lower floors
and knew not to underestimate them.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:10.210
But that monster was far beyond anything we imagined...

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.630
Please! Little Rookie!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.830
I know my friends are stuck somewhere on this floor.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:23.080
On top of that, Dormul's party should
also be... exploring this floor now...

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:24.960
Even he's down here?!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.750
So, we're dealing with a monster

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.670
that figured out adventurers are basically
a walking magic stone buffet. Great.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:35.580
Well, shit. We picked a hell of
a time to go on an expedition.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.880
I'll tell you right now that
we can't let that thing go unchecked.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.250
Either we take it out now,

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.670
or a Guild extermination squad will do it later.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:48.290
I'm of the mind that we should kill it here and now.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.250
The longer that it takes, the worse the situation will get.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.540
And I refuse to just leave Mr. Luvis' companions behind.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:57.960
You said it.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.790
And if that monster is on the lookout for these...

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.170
then it should come right to us.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.290
Yep.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.170
Besides, we don't know if these two will
last long enough for us to reach the surface.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:12.380
And there's no guarantee the Dea Saint
could cure a parasitic infection like this.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:17.580
That may be true, but we also can't say for sure
that defeating the monster will cure it either!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.540
Actually, I think the odds of that are pretty high.

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:25.210
Moss Huge is a monster that typically splits
its moss apart and then creates copies of itself,

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:27.460
but those always disappear if you defeat the main body.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.630
What? Come on, don't give me that look!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:34.540
I want to avoid fighting it as much as you do!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:39.420
But from what we've heard,
I don't think it's going to let us escape.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.960
Well, we've all spoken our piece.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.250
Master Bell is the one who makes the final call.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.670
We will defeat the monster!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:58.630
Let's start by heading for the area where
Mr. Luvis and his friends were first attacked.

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:05.420
I'm very... sorry...

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.580
Huh? It's okay, don't be.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.380
I'm also just a level 2.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.830
I should be apologizing to you.

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:20.000
If only I had more skills as a healer,
then I could have saved you right away.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.420
I still have faith.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:28.460
No matter what happens...
everyone will pull through... together...

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.210
Miss Chigusa...

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:36.330
What I want to know is why there have been no
eyewitness reports of that Moss Huge this whole time.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.000
It's strange.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.210
It probably avoided being seen...

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.380
by never fighting anyone stronger than it.

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:48.290
And only attacking adventurers
that it could definitely defeat.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:53.000
That's what we're dealing with. Something very crafty.

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:58.080
You have to be careful. That monster is... different...

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:06.920
Look at this!

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:10.460
A trail of blood...

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.290
Let's follow it.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.250
How awful...

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.790
Chariot... Lana...!

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:36.830
Are those your friends?

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.960
Yeah. But I don't see Aleck anywhere!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.500
This is gonna be a huge pain.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:46.080
If we make any move to save those elves,

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.830
not only will that enhanced monster attack,

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.080
but so will a whole bunch of ordinary ones.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:53.460
You're saying it knew that we'd come?

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:57.790
That's insane... a monster setting a trap like this...

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:02.290
The best way to win would be taking them
all out from here with ranged magic attacks,

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.790
but those elves would get caught in the crossfire.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:09.750
Master Bell and Lady Aisha, you two are in charge of
taking out the Moss Huge.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:16.330
Master Welf, Lady Mikoto, Master Ouka. You three need
to defeat the other monsters and save the elves.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:20.080
Meanwhile, the rest of us will stay here
and watch so we don't get in the way.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.460
Sound good?

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.250
A solid plan.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.210
Just one thing. You're not going to stay here.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.130
Head for the large room.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:38.380
This is gonna be a messy fight
that you don't want to watch.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.880
R-right!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:44.460
Let's do this.

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:49.380
D-don't... come...

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.500
It's not here... this is just...

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.920
Back off!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:21.580
Bell!

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:27.960
It's going to be okay.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:38.960
Master Bell!

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.380
FIRE BOLT!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:52.960
Did it just try to cripple my ability to use magic?!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.080
You won't get away!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:06.380
Master Bell!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.250
Oh crap! This is bad!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.040
No! Master Bell!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.880
W-we gotta hurry and save him!

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:42.710
You can't!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:43.670
Stop, Liliruca!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.500
Have you lost your mind?!

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.540
We already went over how dangerous
the rapids are around here!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.790
I know, but Master Bell! He's in trouble!

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:58.330
We took care of the other monsters.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:01.000
Help us get the injured people out of here.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:02.790
You guys...

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.960
Lana... Chariot... Aleck!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.830
Lady Aisha! Master Bell is gone!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.380
I know. I saw everything.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:25.500
Unfortunately... I can't sense
Master Bell anywhere near here.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.000
That can't be!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.670
Let me make this clear to you all!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.500
Nobody is going off to save Bell Cranel!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.460
W-wait a minute, Lady Aisha!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.540
There's no way we can just leave hi-!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.540
Keep your head on straight, strategist!

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:40.630
It's obvious we can't catch up to him now!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.040
Especially not with injured in tow!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:47.040
I'm so sorry. I failed at being the decoy...

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:47.500
Besides, this is Bell Cranel we're talking about.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.210
He's more than capable of soloing
his way out of these floors.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.500
It's not your fault, Luvis.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.960
The fact that we're all still alive is a miracle, honestly.

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.380
I can attest that his status is far from the norm.

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:56.380
He's already better than most middle-grade level 4s.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:59.790
In terms of agility alone,
he's certainly among the best of the best.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.540
I hate to admit this, but Bell Cranel
is stronger than I am at this point.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.750
I'm confident he's found his way to survive
whatever trouble that water gave him.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.210
Lady Aisha...

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.750
We should be more concerned about ourselves, frankly.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.170
Am I wrong?

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.920
The party's safety takes top priority right now!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.630
If anything happens to us, then
we'll only be a bigger hindrance to Master Bell.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.580
Okay, fine. But are you really okay with that?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.580
I have faith that Master Bell is alive.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:33.960
You should, too.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:39.170
Considering that the situation has changed,
I suggest that we retreat from this floor immediately.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:43.960
But just intermediate retreat.
We won't be returning to the surface.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:47.790
We're going back to the cliff that was near
the entrance when we first arrived on this floor.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.000
That area should be free of any aquatic monsters,

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.710
and it puts us in a position
to avoid surprise attacks by the Moss Huge.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.670
We'll establish a temporary base of operations there.

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:02.290
Lady Aisha, you should proceed alone back
to Rivira and put in a request for help.

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:06.210
In the meantime, the rest of us will make use of Lady
Haruhime's magic,

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.580
to protect the injured until a rescue party arrives.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:13.330
Okay, but what happens if we get assaulted
by that enhanced monster again?

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:17.460
Without Bell Cranel or Antianeira around,
we won't have any hope of fighting it.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.670
Actually, that's exactly what I'm planning on.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:20.420
Huh?

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.500
We'll be waiting on a straight road with no escape route.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:27.500
By luring it up to us, we can have
Lady Mikoto use her gravity spell

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:31.960
to destroy the entire passageway and
send it plummeting way down to the bottom.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.460
And crush it flat!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:41.580
Our only major problem is if the injured can hold out and
we make it back to that location in one piece.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.500
What do you think of my plan?

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:45.920
I like it.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.170
Alright! Get ready to move on the double!

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.580
Master Bell...

00:18:58.130 --> 00:18:59.460
Please forgive me.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.710
I fell from all the way up there?

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.580
I gotta hurry and get back to the others.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.580
Oh no! Not the Iguazu!

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:45.750
Well, the one that you most need to watch out
for is a flying monster called Iguazu.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.330
The fastest monster on the lower floors!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.790
They look like a blur! And there are so many!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.420
Ugh! No way!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.080
What do I do?! Come on! Think fast!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.500
There's not enough time for me to run for a cave!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:06.000
And there are others monsters in the water!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.540
This is the reality of the dungeon!? Of the lower floors?!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:10.830
I'm screwed!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.670
Everybody else is definitely fighting
their own fight right now.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.130
And I made them a promise!

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.000
That we'd all get stronger together!

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:27.210
If Miss Ais were here...

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.080
I know this is what she'd do!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.080
Bring it on!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.420
Move faster!

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.210
Fight harder!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.500
Is something wrong, Miss Lili?

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.380
No. It's nothing.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:50.630
Wait.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.710
Something's coming this way.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:01.920
Dormul!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:03.790
Luvis!

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:05.830
So you guys are still alive!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:10.040
I take it you're the other party that
Master Luvis was telling us about, then?

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:12.420
It's a relief to see that you're... okay...

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.580
Seems that we all... bit off more than we could chew...

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.500
A mermaid...?

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Mermaid</b>

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>The Girl of Water City</b>

00:23:37.630 --> 00:23:39.790
Next time: "Mermaid."
